{"availability":"available","full":"Automattic/wp-codebox","name":"wp-codebox","description":"Disposable WordPress Playground sandboxes for securely isolated agentic workflows. ","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":18,"forks":4,"created":"2026-05-16T21:20:30Z","updated":"2026-10-15T12:55:39Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://wordpress.github.io/wordpress-playground/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:41.802Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:41.802Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:41.802Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:14:02.981Z","stars":17,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-04T21:35:13.515Z","stars":18,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-06T22:53:56.044Z","stars":18,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-09T05:46:51.891Z","stars":18,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-12T07:56:31.162Z","stars":18,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-15T15:01:41.802Z","stars":18,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Adversarial campaign, transport fault, service disruption, browser oracle, and sealed replay contracts are documented in docs/adversarial-runtime.md.","WP Codebox unlocks secure WordPress code execution from anywhere. Run agents, accept untrusted patches, evaluate plugins, reproduce bugs, or experiment freely - every sandbox is a disposable contained WordPress runtime that can't touch its caller. Your host can be a CLI, CI job, mobile app, Node service, WordPress plugin, or anything else that can shell out or hit an API.","WP Codebox is the runtime boundary for agent-built or workflow-built outputs. It is not the agent framework, the review UI, the deploy system, or the production site mutator. The WordPress plugin in this repo is one optional host adapter (useful when the host is a WordPress site); the core CLI/runtime works anywhere node can run."],"features":["Letting non-technical site owners request, review, and approve bounded coding changes from a WordPress UI or chat surface.","Running a managed coding community where users submit tasks and maintainers approve sandboxed artifacts before anything reaches real code.","Supporting WordPress contributors with disposable reproduction, patch, review, and test-result artifacts that can be shared before commit or PR creation."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Automattic/wp-codebox/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"afbff051a9b210d23c74eb568200da5c4ad2e469dc438120232d11daa68a915b","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:42.011Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:42.011Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Adversarial campaign, transport fault, service disruption, browser oracle, and sealed replay contracts are documented in docs/adversarial-runtime.md.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Automattic/wp-codebox/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Self-hosted WordPress control planes should install the CLI on the same host","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Automattic/wp-codebox/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"afbff051a9b210d23c74eb568200da5c4ad2e469dc438120232d11daa68a915b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Automattic/wp-codebox/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:42.012Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T12:55:39Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Automattic/wp-codebox/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:42.016Z","hash":"afbff051a9b210d23c74eb568200da5c4ad2e469dc438120232d11daa68a915b","originalBytes":111501,"storedBytes":111501,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["runtime","wp-codebox","wordpress","codebox","files","artifact","run","json","artifacts","plugin","when","browser","command","npm","sandbox","task","recipe","mount","path","kind","without","host","preview","same","agent","optional","before","metadata","plugins","cli","review","workspace","evidence","schema","source","through","capture","generic","playground","prod